------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=11 nanghaithya answers
Text=Aeshma. They kept you in a box under a church and you came out of it grateful, running errands for the thing that opened the lid. Ahriman will hear which of us was the coward.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=12 pain replies
Text=He will hear it from whichever of us is still standing, so tell it carefully.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the warning
Text=<It is sitting on a broken wall with its chin on its fist, entirely at ease.> Your spirit has already told you there is something ahead. Spirits are good at that and no use at all afterwards. I am here to be of use afterwards, and then we are done with each other.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then be of use.
Go to node ID=2 the name

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You owe me nothing. Stay out of my way.
