------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 the name
Text=The thing ahead is called Nanghaithya. Not the name it offers -- the one it was made with. A daeva cannot lie about its name and cannot stand to hear it said correctly; say it to her face and she will have to stop and argue with you instead of eating you. That is the debt discharged. Do not come looking for me again.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nanghaithya. I will remember it.
